          "author": "Caspar Babypants",
          "description": "Having traded in Rock n Roll for Rockabye Baby, Caspar Babypants joined the world of children’s music in 2009, and hasn’t looked back since. \n\nWhat could be better than a collection of songs that the whole family can enjoy? Beatles Songs is the perfect child-friendly collection of the most popular hits from The Beatles throughout history. From ‘Hey Jude’ to ‘Yellow Submarine’, show your kids what great music really sounds like, and boogie the day away together! ",
